THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Forge distributes no third-party binaries. The macOS application bundle
contains only Vulkgryph LLC's own executable and generated resources; GPU
rendering goes through Apple's Metal framework, which is part of the
operating system.

Forge does link third-party Rust crates, predominantly under the MIT and
Apache-2.0 licenses, along with libgit2 and OpenSSL compiled from source.
These are declared in the Cargo.toml of each workspace member and pinned in
Cargo.lock, which together are the authoritative dependency list.


